msgid "Every station this device can see, with its addresses, the network it sits on, and its traffic split between the LAN and the WAN."
msgstr "本设备可见的所有终端：地址、所属网络，以及局域网与广域网分流后的流量。"

msgid "LAN counts traffic to other addresses inside this network; WAN counts everything else. Rates are differentiated from kernel conntrack counters, which keep counting for hardware-offloaded flows."
msgstr "局域网统计发往本网络内其他地址的流量，广域网统计其余全部。速率由内核 conntrack 计数器差分得出，硬件卸载的连接同样计数。"

msgid "The subtotals are what this view has seen since it was opened. conntrack counters belong to a flow, so a flow that ends takes its bytes with it - treat the figure as a floor, not a lifetime total."
msgstr "小计为本次打开页面以来观察到的量。conntrack 计数属于具体连接，连接结束其字节数随之消失，因此该数字只是下界，并非累计总量。"

msgid "addresses are coloured by who assigned them"
msgstr "地址颜色表示分配方式"

msgid "Aggregate traffic of every client this device can see, split between the local network and the internet."
msgstr "本设备可见的全部客户端流量汇总，按局域网与互联网分别统计。"

msgid "Realtime traffic trends"
msgstr "实时流量趋势"

msgid "Type"
msgstr "类型"

msgid "Window"
msgstr "时间窗"

msgid "Last 5 minutes"
msgstr "最近 5 分钟"

msgid "Last 10 minutes"
msgstr "最近 10 分钟"

msgid "Last 25 minutes"
msgstr "最近 25 分钟"

msgid "Upload rate"
msgstr "上传速率"

msgid "Download rate"
msgstr "下载速率"

msgid "Traffic trend"
msgstr "流量趋势"

msgid "Upload and download rates over the selected window."
msgstr "所选时间窗内的上行与下行速率。"

msgid "No samples yet. The chart appears as soon as the background collector records one."
msgstr "暂无采样数据，后台采集器记录一条后曲线即会出现。"

msgid "Traffic counted by the background collector since it started. conntrack counters belong to a flow, so the figure is a floor, not a lifetime total."
msgstr "后台采集器启动以来累计的流量。conntrack 计数属于具体连接，因此只是下界，并非累计总量。"

msgid "This month"
msgstr "本月"

msgid "Long-term counters need the nlbwmon package"
msgstr "长期统计需安装 nlbwmon 软件包"

msgid "The month column comes from nlbwmon, which records every stream when it closes and therefore can give a real period total. It requires the nlbwmon package; without it the column stays empty and nothing else changes."
msgstr "“本月”列来自 nlbwmon：它在每条连接关闭时记录最终字节数，因此能给出真实的周期总量。该列需要安装 nlbwmon，未安装时整列为空，其余功能不受影响。"

msgid "Every station this device can see, with its addresses, the network it sits on, and its WAN traffic."
msgstr "本设备可见的所有终端：地址、所属网络，以及广域网流量。"

msgid "WAN counts traffic to addresses outside this network; traffic between local hosts is not shown. Rates are differentiated from kernel conntrack counters, which keep counting for hardware-offloaded flows."
msgstr "广域网统计发往本网络之外地址的流量，本地主机之间的流量不显示。速率由内核 conntrack 计数器差分得出，硬件卸载的连接同样计数。"

msgid "Live rate"
msgstr "实时速率"

msgid "Total traffic"
msgstr "总流量"

msgid "What the clients on this LAN exchanged with each other, counted by the hardware port counters."
msgstr "本机局域网内各客户端之间交换的流量，由硬件端口计数器统计。"

msgid "Rates are differentiated from kernel conntrack counters, which keep counting for hardware-offloaded flows. The bracketed figures are counted by the background collector since it started - conntrack counters belong to a flow, so they are a floor, not a lifetime total. LAN traffic is what this box routed between LAN subnets; frames between two clients of the same subnet are switched by the bridge and never reach conntrack."
msgstr "速率由内核 conntrack 计数器差分得出，硬件卸载的连接同样计数。括号内数字为后台采集器启动以来的累计值；conntrack 计数属于具体连接，因此只是下界，并非累计总量。局域网流量为本机在各局域网子网之间转发的流量；同一子网内两台客户端之间的数据帧由网桥直接转发，不会进入 conntrack。"

msgid "This device bridges, so the figures come from the hardware port counters: WAN is the traffic through the uplink port, LAN is what the remaining ports carried. The bracketed figures are counted by the background collector since it started."
msgstr "本设备工作在桥接模式，流量取自硬件端口计数器：广域网为经上联端口的流量，局域网为其余端口承载的流量。括号内数字为后台采集器启动以来的累计值。"

msgid "What stayed inside the LAN: traffic this box routed between LAN subnets, plus the frames two clients exchanged with each other, counted by an nftables rule on the bridge. A switched frame has no direction, so it is counted under both arrows."
msgstr "本机局域网内的流量：本机在各子网之间转发的部分，加上两台客户端之间交换的帧（由网桥上的 nftables 规则统计）。交换帧没有方向，因此在上下两个箭头里各计一次。"
